sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor I as Inspector
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant VIN as VIN Decoder Service
  participant PG as PostgreSQL (vin_cache)
  participant EXT as External VIN API
  I->>GW: GET /vin/{vin}
  GW->>GW: validate JWT + role INSPECTOR
  GW->>VIN: decode(vin)
  VIN->>VIN: validate format & check digit
  VIN->>PG: SELECT from vin_cache
  alt cache hit
    PG-->>VIN: decoded specs
  else cache miss
    VIN->>EXT: HTTPS decode request
    EXT-->>VIN: make, model, year, body, engine
    VIN->>PG: INSERT into vin_cache
  end
  VIN-->>I: decoded vehicle data (pre-fills form)
